## Components and Interfaces

### Component 1: TenantConfig（租户配置管理）

**Purpose:** 管理租户的 MT5/MT4 服务器配置，支持从数据库加载和热更新

**File:** `include/services/TenantConfig.h`, `src/services/TenantConfig.cpp`

```cpp
// include/services/TenantConfig.h

#pragma once
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <unordered_map>
#include <mutex>
#include <json/json.h>
#include "services/ITradingPlatform.h"

namespace services {

struct ServerConfig {
    std::string serverId;           // "main-server"
    std::string displayName;        // "主服务器"
    std::string address;            // "192.168.1.100:1950"
    uint64_t managerLogin;
    std::string managerPasswordEncrypted;
    PlatformType platformType;      // MT5 or MT4
    bool isActive;

    Json::Value toJson() const;
};

struct TenantInfo {
    std::string tenantId;           // UUID
    std::string tenantCode;         // "company-a"
    std::string name;               // "Company A Trading"
    std::string customDomain;       // "trade.company-a.com"
    std::string deploymentMode;     // "shared" or "dedicated"
    std::string middlewareUrl;      // 专用中间件URL (dedicated模式)
    std::vector<ServerConfig> servers;

    Json::Value toJson() const;
};

class TenantConfigManager {
public:
    TenantConfigManager(const std::string& dbConnectionString);

    // 加载所有活跃租户配置
    bool loadAllTenants();

    // 获取租户信息
    std::optional<TenantInfo> getTenant(const std::string& tenantId);
    std::optional<TenantInfo> getTenantByCode(const std::string& code);
    std::optional<TenantInfo> getTenantByDomain(const std::string& domain);

    // 获取服务器配置
    std::optional<ServerConfig> getServerConfig(const std::string& tenantId,
                                                 const std::string& serverId);

    // 热更新
    void reloadTenant(const std::string& tenantId);
    void removeTenant(const std::string& tenantId);

    // 获取所有租户列表
    std::vector<TenantInfo> getAllTenants();

private:
    std::string m_dbConnectionString;
    std::unordered_map<std::string, TenantInfo> m_tenants;          // tenantId -> info
    std::unordered_map<std::string, std::string> m_codeToId;        // code -> tenantId
    std::unordered_map<std::string, std::string> m_domainToId;      // domain -> tenantId
    mutable std::mutex m_mutex;

    bool loadFromDatabase();
};

} // namespace services
```

**Dependencies:** PostgreSQL client library
**Reuses:** CredentialEncryption for password decryption

